{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121579","id":4093953264,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70BMTw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121579","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121579.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121579.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121579","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121579/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121579/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121579/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/67c0c3dab88308551ec8d1c367bd33fcf9fd491a","number":121579,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implemented new \"@export_translation\" annotation.","user":{"login":"bluebirdsan","id":60063904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDYzOTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60063904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan","html_url":"https://github.com/bluebirdsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluebirdsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10139\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104021\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\n- I wanted to add translations to my game, but I couldn't find a way to mark exported `String`s to be include in the translation template. Then I found the above-mentioned proposal which suggested a workaround of appending `String` names with `_text`. This worked, but is not intuitive and forces to name variables a certain way. Also this was not documented.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Added new `@export_translation` annotation which sets the new `PROPERTY_USAGE_TRANSLATION` `PropertyUsageFlag`.\r\n- This annotation works for `String`, `Array[String]`, and `PackedStringArray`. Before, you could not include `String` arrays in the template, even by appending the name with `_text`.   This can be useful, if you want to export an array of strings from which you pick at runtime and want the strings to be translated.\r\n- When parsing `PackedScene`s for translation, exported sub-resources and arrays that contain them are now parsed as well. Before (at least by my testing) sub-resources were not parsed for the translation template, which seems like an oversight to me so I implemented this as well.   This is useful when implementing a dialog system, where you'd have a `Dialog` resource which has an array of `DialogLine` resources which have `String`s with the `@export_translation`.\r\n- Added new documentation.\r\n\r\n## Compatibility\r\n\r\n- These changes will probably break some projects, where developers found out they can append `String` names with `_text` to include them in the translation template. But as I mentioned earlier, this is a workaround and isn't documented, so I doubt a lot of people used this.\r\n- The new annotation is only checked for user created things. So the built-in `Control`s are not affected and their properties are still matched against `lookup_properties` as before.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAI was used to inquire how the back-end works. All changes are human written.\r\n\r\n## Ending notes\r\n\r\nI find this addition to be very useful (at least for me), because using annotations is much more explicit and less bug prone, than having to add `_text` to string names. Plus by adding sub-resource and array parsing I can create translatable dialog resources by just annotating a few strings.\r\n\r\nIf you notice any problems please tell me so I could fix them!\r\nThe worst that could happen is I learn more stuff :)\r\n\r\nI have never contributed to any project, but found it very fun! So after this I think I will tackle:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109256\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/73565\r\n- other translation related improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-20T19:28:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T10:50:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T19:55:45Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6b4773b9374b48e19947e42785d1563cb